            <fr:title text="Products of Categories as Total Categories">Products of Categories as Total Categories</fr:title>
          </fr:frontmatter>
          <fr:mainmatter>
            <html:p>Given <fr:link href="/sss-00EC/" title="Category" uri="https://stevenschaefer.net/sss-00EC/" display-uri="sss-00EC" type="local">categories</fr:link> <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\mathcal {C}]]></fr:tex> and <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\mathcal {D}]]></fr:tex>, <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\mathcal {C} \times  \mathcal {D}]]></fr:tex>
is equivalent to the total category of <fr:link href="/sss-006D/" title="Weakening a Category" uri="https://stevenschaefer.net/sss-006D/" display-uri="sss-006D" type="local">weakening</fr:link>.</html:p>
