            <fr:title text="Displayed Total Category">Displayed Total Category</fr:title>
            <fr:taxon>Definition</fr:taxon>
          </fr:frontmatter>
          <fr:mainmatter>
            <html:p>Given a <fr:link href="/sss-00EB/" title="Displayed Category" uri="https://stevenschaefer.net/sss-00EB/" display-uri="sss-00EB" type="local">displayed category</fr:link> <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\overline {\mathcal {C}}]]></fr:tex> over a
<fr:link href="/sss-00EC/" title="Category" uri="https://stevenschaefer.net/sss-00EC/" display-uri="sss-00EC" type="local">category</fr:link> <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\mathcal {C}]]></fr:tex> and another displayed category <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\overline {\mathcal {D}}]]></fr:tex>
over <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\int  \overline {\mathcal {C}}]]></fr:tex>, the total category of <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\overline {\mathcal {C}}]]></fr:tex>, we can define
<fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\overline {\int } \overline {\mathcal {D}}]]></fr:tex>, the <html:em>displayed total category</html:em> of <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\overline {\mathcal {D}}]]></fr:tex>,
as a displayed category over <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\mathcal {C}]]></fr:tex>.</html:p>
            <fr:tex display="block"><![CDATA[{\mathopen {}\left (\overline {\int } \overline {\mathcal {D}}\right )\mathclose {}}_{c} \colonequals  \mathchoice {\textstyle \sum _{{\mathopen {}\left (\overline {c} : \overline {\mathcal {C}}_{c}\right )\mathclose {}}}}{\textstyle \sum _{{\mathopen {}\left (\overline {c} : \overline {\mathcal {C}}_{c}\right )\mathclose {}}}}{\scriptstyle \sum _{{\mathopen {}\left (\overline {c} : \overline {\mathcal {C}}_{c}\right )\mathclose {}}}}{\scriptscriptstyle \sum _{{\mathopen {}\left (\overline {c} : \overline {\mathcal {C}}_{c}\right )\mathclose {}}}}{\overline {\mathcal {D}}_{{\mathopen {}\left (c , \overline {c}\right )\mathclose {}}}}]]></fr:tex>
          </fr:mainmatter>
        </fr:tree>
