            <fr:title text="Reindexing of a Displayed Category">Reindexing of a Displayed Category</fr:title>
            <fr:taxon>Definition</fr:taxon>
          </fr:frontmatter>
          <fr:mainmatter>
            <html:p>Given a <fr:link href="/sss-00EB/" title="Displayed Category" uri="https://stevenschaefer.net/sss-00EB/" display-uri="sss-00EB" type="local">displayed category</fr:link> <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\overline {\mathcal {C}}]]></fr:tex> over a
<fr:link href="/sss-00EC/" title="Category" uri="https://stevenschaefer.net/sss-00EC/" display-uri="sss-00EC" type="local">category</fr:link> <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\mathcal {C}]]></fr:tex> and a functor <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[F : \mathcal {D} \to  \mathcal {C}]]></fr:tex>, the
<html:em>reindexing of <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\overline {\mathcal {C}}]]></fr:tex> along <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[F]]></fr:tex></html:em> is a displayed category over
<fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\mathcal {D}]]></fr:tex>. It is simply the portion of <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\overline {\mathcal {C}}]]></fr:tex> over the image of <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[F]]></fr:tex>.
</html:p>
            <fr:tex display="block"><![CDATA[{\mathopen {}\left (\mathsf {reindex}_{F}{\mathopen {}\left (\overline {\mathcal {C}}\right )\mathclose {}}\right )\mathclose {}}_{d} \colonequals  \overline {\mathcal {C}}_{F d}]]></fr:tex>
          </fr:mainmatter>
        </fr:tree>
